Nasty. The sanity message is telling us that an object which the game
thinks is in your inventory doesn't think it's in your inventory. It
thinks it's free. This represents a nasty bug. It's possible that this
is already fixed in 7E7 (there was at least one bug fix that could
cause this in 7E6F3). In order to track it down, we really need to know
what caused the problem. If you see something similar in future, please
try and remember what you were doing when it first occurred and log a
bug report so that we can try and track it down.

